ers/peaceshi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peaceshi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T18:32:05Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T18:32:05Z","body":"> This is likely due to the same cause as [#71929](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/71929), but it's exacerbated by the Vulkan layer OBS uses to perform game capture.这可能是由于与 [#71929](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/71929) 相同的原因为，但被 OBS 使用来执行游戏捕获的 Vulkan 层加剧了。\n> \n> on Windows, can you reproduce this after changing `rendering_driver.windows` to `d3d12` in the Project Settings then restarting the editor?在 Windows 上，您能否在将项目设置中的 `rendering_driver.windows` 更改为 `d3d12` 后重启编辑器后重现此问题？\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8e48b31-db36-41c1-88e6-3804a4a2ed87)\n\nIt seems like d3d12 works well.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698550704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704272689","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103490#issuecomment-2704272689","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103490","id":2704272689,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hL-0x","user":{"login":"peaceshi","id":10380828,"node_